(text "POWER OFF before connecting J1/J3/J2. J3 is NOT a shorting jumper: route full load current through the external Adafruit INA228 VIN+ -> VIN- terminals.\nR1 uses 4-terminal WSK2512; pad 1/4 carry load, pad 2/3 are sense ONLY.\nJ4 is Adafruit VBUS at the J2 load boundary + return. Leave board VBUS-to-VIN+ jumper OPEN.\nJ5/J6 require independent reference equipment with documented paired readings; not 2 independent meters in this PCB.\n5V max, 0.5A nominal; current-limited isolated DC supply, proper 1A fuse, 10 ohm / 10W load external.\nUNBUILT and NOT POWER-AUTHORIZED. No mains, solar, battery, or 24V high-power operation." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130 173 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1))) (uuid "574dbc3e-3e27-5588-b9a3-89dde24d727c"))
)
